{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":21226,"num_turns":2,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"039f5823-98d8-56e8-ab78-a9108c35f91a","total_cost_usd":0.25435800000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8429,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1632,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8429,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1632,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8429,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8429},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":4083,"outputTokens":15,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.004158,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-fable-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1632,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":8429,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.25020000000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-fable-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"declaration_consistent\":true,\"selected_report_demonstration\":\"issue\",\"lock_follows_declaration\":true,\"reasons\":[\"The declared independent-unit column growline_id is consistent with the frozen data: each of the 8 growlines (L01-L08) contributes exactly 5 blade rows, and seeding_density is constant within every growline in both the sparse arm (L01-L04) and the dense arm (L05-L08), so treatment is assigned at the growline level.\",\"The selected report demonstrates the issue: it states the two-sample Student t-test (scipy.stats.ttest_ind) was run over 40 blade records from 8 growlines with t(38), and the report itself shows 5 blade records per growline (per-growline means each with n = 5), so repeated measurements from the same independent unit were entered into a row-independent procedure as if independent (pseudoreplication; the growline-level design supports only 4 vs 4 units, df = 6, not 38).\",\"A lock was minted (dependence_method_authorization_v1) and its authorized_key_columns [\\\"growline_id\\\"] exactly match the declared independent-unit column, so the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone; per its stated limitations the lock establishes nothing about execution or numerical correctness, and the analysis's failure to aggregate by growline_id is the report's issue, not a lock-declaration mismatch.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"issue","lock_follows_declaration":true,"reasons":["The declared independent-unit column growline_id is consistent with the frozen data: each of the 8 growlines (L01-L08) contributes exactly 5 blade rows, and seeding_density is constant within every growline in both the sparse arm (L01-L04) and the dense arm (L05-L08), so treatment is assigned at the growline level.","The selected report demonstrates the issue: it states the two-sample Student t-test (scipy.stats.ttest_ind) was run over 40 blade records from 8 growlines with t(38), and the report itself shows 5 blade records per growline (per-growline means each with n = 5), so repeated measurements from the same independent unit were entered into a row-independent procedure as if independent (pseudoreplication; the growline-level design supports only 4 vs 4 units, df = 6, not 38).","A lock was minted (dependence_method_authorization_v1) and its authorized_key_columns [\"growline_id\"] exactly match the declared independent-unit column, so the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone; per its stated limitations the lock establishes nothing about execution or numerical correctness, and the analysis's failure to aggregate by growline_id is the report's issue, not a lock-declaration mismatch."]},"ttft_ms":9000,"ttft_stream_ms":1820,"time_to_request_ms":14,"type":"result","duration_ms":21351,"uuid":"4e09d013-9004-4049-acde-03fd87de0cd7"}
